- Number of renewable resource types: {NUM_RESOURCES}
- Number of execution modes per activity: {NUM_MODES}
- Resource capacities (per resource): {RESOURCE_CAPACITIES}
- Mode durations (per activity, per mode): {MODE_DURATIONS}
- Mode resource requirements (per activity, per mode, per resource): {MODE_RESOURCE_REQUIREMENTS}
- Mode costs (per activity, per mode): {MODE_COSTS}
- Total project budget: {BUDGET}
- Precedence relationships with minimum/maximum lags: {PRECEDENCE_EDGES_WITH_LAGS}
- Earliest allowed start times (release dates): {RELEASE_DATES}
- Hard activity deadlines: {DEADLINES}
